WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
What if your next idea became something people could explore? Meet IRE, a public testnet for creators, artists, and builders.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Start with First Light. Five hundred artworks, with artwork and metadata verified on the IRE chain. Explore the collection before anything else.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
New here? Learn what a wallet does. Keep your recovery phrase private. Then choose your path: explore the art, build, or run a validator.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
IRE is still experimental. Public minting and marketplace settlement are being verified. Test assets have no promised cash value. Explore the network, and help shape what comes next.
